  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "地產科技與區塊鏈應用",
    "sub_ename": "PROPERTY TECHNOLOGY AND BLOCKCHAIN APPLICATION",
    "describe_ch": "近來新科技對各產業都產生莫大影響，不動產也一樣不能免於這股潮流，即是所謂地產科技也成為不動產業的熱門詞彙。本門課主要在於導引學生了解目前國際上針對地產科技討論的範疇，並特別針對區塊鏈技術進行較為深入的教學與操作。 \r\n",
    "describe_eh": "Recently, the rapid development of new technology has created profound impact in every discipline, including the real estate, which is called Property Technology. Because this is the knowledge that students have to have in their future career. The course, therefore is designed to provide a chance to let students understand the core issues of Protec in the international perspectives and pay more attention at the blockchain technology.      \r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "學生了解區塊鏈技術之概念與不動產之關係\t",
      "describe_en": "Understanding the core concepts of blockchain and possible application in real estate market"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "學生能了解並操作加密貨幣與NFT\t",
      "describe_en": "Abilities in operation the cryptocurrency account and NFT"
    }
  ],
